{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ReactingToChanges"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use events to decouple the code that notices something from the code that responds to it:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a physics step sends a collision, and separate damage and sound systems each read it. Declare"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an event as a type that conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"type":"text","text":", send it with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/send(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and read it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/readEvents(_:by:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct Collision: Event { var first: Entity, second: Entity }","enum DamageReader {}","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Health(current: 3))","let asteroid = world.spawn(Health(current: 1))","world.send(Collision(first: ship, second: asteroid))","","for collision in world.readEvents(Collision.self, by: DamageReader.self) {","    world[Health.self, of: collision.first].current -= 1","}","print(world[Health.self, of: ship])","\/\/ Prints \"Health(current: 2)\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Events wait in the world’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Events","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" resource until "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/updateEvents()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" drops them,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so senders and readers don’t need to run at the same moment. Unlike an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event isn’t aimed at an entity and runs no code when sent."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Events","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EventsView"],"title":"Sending Events","anchor":"Sending-Events"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/event"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule5EventP","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"symbolKind":"protocol","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Protocol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Events.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Events.swift#L27"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Event"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From"},{"type":"conformingTypes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RemovedComponent"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforming Types"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that describes a message one part of a program sends and other parts read later."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/EntityEvent":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EntityEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent","abstract":[{"text":"A type that describes something that happens to a particular entity, which its observers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"respond to at once.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"EntityEvent","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/entityevent","role":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/RemovedComponent":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RemovedComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The event a world sends when an entity loses a component of type ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RemovedComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/removedcomponent","title":"RemovedComponent","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RemovedComponent"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Event":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that describes a message one part of a program sends and other parts read later."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/event","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","title":"Event","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/readEvents(_:by:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns the events of a type that a reader hasn’t read yet, oldest first, and marks them","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as read by that reader.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/readevents(_:by:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/readEvents(_:by:)","title":"readEvents(_:by:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"readEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Reader"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Reader"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10EventsViewV","text":"EventsView"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/ReactingToChanges":{"kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Find the components that changed or went away, run code as changes happen, and pass messages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"between the parts of a program."}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/reactingtochanges","title":"Reacting to Changes","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ReactingToChanges"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule":{"abstract":[{"text":"Store the state of a game or simulation as entities and components, and read and change it with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"queries, updates, and commands.","type":"text"}],"role":"